{%- comment -%}
  Product card — the price.

  **The figure is the price of the variant the button posts**, which is what
  `snippets/card-option.liquid` resolves: the dearest available variant in the
  metal the card currently stands on. It used to read "From <cheapest>"
  whenever the metal's variants differed, which became a trap the moment the
  button started posting the dearest — one figure on the card, another in the
  bag. The karats the piece comes in are said in words by the "Available in"
  block instead, which is what that note is for.

  **The tax note is a sibling, not part of this element**, and that is the
  reason it can be a block at all. `theme.js` replaces this element's whole
  `innerHTML` on a metal pick, so anything rendered inside it is wiped by the
  first swatch click — which is exactly why `snippets/product-card.liquid` has
  to capture the note *inside* the price markup. Out here it is never touched,
  which is the arrangement the quick view already uses: "the note is a sibling
  of the figure, so a pick rewrites the figure's own text node and the note is
  never touched."
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign product = block.settings.product | default: closest.product

  assign chosen = blank
  if product != blank
    capture card_option_raw
      render 'card-option', product: product
    endcapture
    assign card_option = card_option_raw | strip | split: '||'
    assign chosen_id = card_option | last | plus: 0
    for variant in product.variants
      if variant.id == chosen_id
        assign chosen = variant
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif
-%}

<span class="card__price" data-card-price {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {%- if product == blank -%}
    {{- 1999 | money -}}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- if chosen.compare_at_price > chosen.price -%}
      <s>{{ chosen.compare_at_price | money }}</s>
    {%- endif -%}
    {{- chosen.price | money -}}
  {%- endif -%}
</span>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:blocks.product_card_price.name",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:blocks.all.content_source_header"
    },
    {
      "type": "product",
      "id": "product",
      "label": "t:blocks.all.product_source.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.all.product_source.info"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:blocks.product_card_price.name",
      "settings": {
        "product": "{{ closest.product }}"
      }
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
